OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FIn 1976 Diane Sheehan was in her
OL,7,     F20s when she gave birth to a baby,
OL,8,     Fand the nurses told her he had
OL,9,     Fdied. But 42 years later she
OL,10,     Freceived an email from her adult
OL,11,     Fson.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 2011, Maltese voters were
OL,14,     Fcalled to the polls to decide
OL,15,     Fwhether Malta should remain one of
OL,16,     Fthe few places in the world where
OL,17,     Fdivorce was not permitted.
